            <div type="translation" resp="part:emfr">
                
                <p n="1">
                    Prosperity! Fortune!
                </p>
                <p n="1-2">
                    Ciṟumuṟi to the managers, accountants and treasurers in the glorious Māheśvara-p-perum-paḷḷi alias the Rājarāja-p-perum-paḷḷi.
                </p>
                <p n="2-4">
                    <supplied reason="subaudible">In</supplied> the temple premises <supplied reason="explanation"><foreign>tiru-maṭai-viḷākam</foreign></supplied> in this temple, from the month of Aṟpaci in the 17th <supplied reason="subaudible">year</supplied>, 
                    including whatever dues
                    ...
                    is given tax-free as means for the glorious services in this temple.
                </p>
                <p n="4-5"></p>
                <p n="5-7"></p>
                <p n="7-10"></p>
            </div>	
            
